---
title: FortiGate Authentication Bypass Exploitation Attempt (CVE-2024-55591)
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a01
status: experimental
description: Detects HTTP/HTTPS requests targeting the FortiOS/FortiProxy websocket authentication-bypass flaw used by The Gentlemen as their primary initial access vector.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-55591
    - https://fortiguard.fortinet.com/threat-actor/6387/the-gentlemen-ransomware
tags:
    - attack.initial_access
    - attack.t1190
logsource:
    category: firewall
    product: fortinet
detection:
    selection:
        uri|contains:
            - '/jsconsole'
            - 'ws://'
        c-uri|contains: '/api/v2/'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate FortiGate admin console usage over the same path in edge cases
level: high

