title: Erlang/OTP SSH Remote Code Execution Attempt (CVE-2025-32433)
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a02
status: experimental
description: Detects anomalous SSH protocol messages sent prior to authentication, consistent with exploitation of the Erlang/OTP SSH RCE flaw used against exposed management infrastructure.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-32433
tags:
    - attack.initial_access
    - attack.t1190
logsource:
    category: application
    service: ssh
detection:
    selection:
        EventType: 'PreAuthChannelRequest'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Non-standard SSH clients performing protocol negotiation quirks
level: high

---
title: NTLM Reflection Privilege Escalation Attempt (CVE-2025-33073)
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a03
status: experimental
description: Detects an NTLM authentication reflected back to the originating host to obtain SYSTEM privileges, consistent with post-compromise privilege escalation reported for The Gentlemen.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-33073
tags:
    - attack.privilege_escalation
    - attack.t1068
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        Image|endswith: '\rundll32.exe'
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'DavSetCookie'
            - 'WebClient'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate WebDAV client activity in rare enterprise configurations
level: medium

---
title: Mass Security Log and Forensic Artifact Clearing
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a04
status: experimental
description: Detects clearing of Windows event logs, prefetch, or PowerShell history in immediate succession, matching The Gentlemen's pre-encryption anti-forensic cleanup.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/the-gentlemen-ransomware-defense-evasion-ttps
tags:
    - attack.defense_evasion
    - attack.t1070.001
    - attack.t1070.004
    - attack.t1070.003
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_wevtutil:
        Image|endswith: '\wevtutil.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: 'cl '
    selection_prefetch:
        CommandLine|contains: '\Windows\Prefetch'
        CommandLine|contains:
            - 'del '
            - 'Remove-Item'
    selection_psreadline:
        CommandLine|contains: 'ConsoleHost_history.txt'
    condition: selection_wevtutil or selection_prefetch or selection_psreadline
falsepositives:
    - Scripted log rotation or IT maintenance jobs
level: high

---
title: Shadow Copy Deletion Preceding Ransomware Detonation
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a05
status: experimental
description: Detects deletion of volume shadow copies via vssadmin, wmic, or PowerShell, a near-certain precursor to The Gentlemen's encryption stage.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/05/28/the-gentlemen-ransomware-dissecting-a-self-propagating-go-encryptor/
tags:
    - attack.impact
    - attack.t1490
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_vssadmin:
        Image|endswith: '\vssadmin.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: 'delete shadows'
    selection_wmic:
        Image|endswith: '\wmic.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: 'shadowcopy delete'
    selection_powershell:
        Image|endswith: '\powershell.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: 'Get-WmiObject Win32_Shadowcopy'
    condition: selection_vssadmin or selection_wmic or selection_powershell
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate backup software managing shadow copy retention
level: high

---
title: Unauthorized Cloudflare Zero Trust Tunnel Registration
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a06
status: experimental
description: Detects installation or execution of the Cloudflare tunnel client (cloudflared) outside approved change windows, matching The Gentlemen's use of covert tunnels for staged exfiltration.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/05/28/the-gentlemen-ransomware-dissecting-a-self-propagating-go-encryptor/
tags:
    - attack.exfiltration
    - attack.t1020
    - attack.command_and_control
    - attack.t1090
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        Image|endswith: '\cloudflared.exe'
        CommandLine|contains: 'tunnel'
    filter_approved:
        User|contains: 'APPROVED_ADMIN_ACCOUNTS'  # populate with authorized change-control accounts
    condition: selection and not filter_approved
falsepositives:
    - Sanctioned Cloudflare Zero Trust deployment by IT/network team
level: high

---
title: GPO Modification Followed by Domain-Wide Binary Push
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a07
status: experimental
description: Detects a Group Policy Object modification closely followed by new executable creation across multiple domain-joined hosts, consistent with The Gentlemen's domain-wide GPO-based encryptor propagation.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/05/28/the-gentlemen-ransomware-dissecting-a-self-propagating-go-encryptor/
tags:
    - attack.lateral_movement
    - attack.t1484.001
    - attack.impact
    - attack.t1486
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_gpo:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\gpscript.exe'
            - '\gpupdate.exe'
    selection_ad_change:
        EventID: 5136
        ObjectClass: 'groupPolicyContainer'
    timeframe: 1h
    condition: selection_gpo and selection_ad_change
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate scheduled GPO software deployment
level: high

---
title: Native CLI Active Directory Enumeration Ahead of Deployment
id: 3e5f6a7b-8c9d-4e2f-a1b2-4c5d6e7f8a08
status: experimental
description: Detects use of built-in Windows tools (net, nltest, dsquery, PowerShell AD module) to enumerate privileged accounts and domain structure, matching The Gentlemen's living-off-the-land reconnaissance ahead of ransomware deployment.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://redpiranha.net/news/the-gentlemen-ransomware-analysis
tags:
    - attack.discovery
    - attack.t1087.002
    - attack.t1018
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\net.exe'
            - '\net1.exe'
            - '\nltest.exe'
            - '\dsquery.exe'
    CommandLine|contains:
        - 'group'
        - 'domain_admins'
        - '/domain_trusts'
        - 'Get-ADUser'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Routine administrative enumeration by IT/helpdesk staff
level: low
